From: filipi87 <filipi87@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:37:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] camera-switch-facing-mode: native switchCamera and facing
 mode getter

MediaStreamTrack._switchCamera() calls native mediaStreamTrackSwitchCamera (resolves
the new facing mode) instead of re-applying constraints; adds
_getCameraFacingMode(). Android keeps the chosen facing mode while the camera is
stopped (muted) and handles devices with more than two cameras.
